<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [512].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>512&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A1 MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaCl                                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;20.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KCl                                                     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.77&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NH<sub>4</sub>Cl                                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.25&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KH<sub>2</sub>PO<sub>4</sub>                                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> DL vitamins (see below)                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> DL minerals (see below)                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaHCO<sub>3</sub>                                               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix ingredients except NaHCO<sub>3</sub>, adjust pH to 6.8 and add NaHCO<sub>3</sub> to the medium. Dispense the medium (9 ml) into 26-ml anaerobic pressure tubes under a stream of oxygen-free N<sub>2</sub>-CO<sub>2</sub> (80:20) and seal. After autoclaving, aseptically and anaerobically add 0.2 ml APM salts solution and 0.1 ml Sulfide stock solution and 0.1 ml Galactose stock solution.  <br>
